<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        border-radius: 5px;
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
        color: white;
        padding: 30px 20px;
        border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
      }
      .content {
        background-color: white;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
      }
      .info-box {
        background-color: #f0fdf4;
        border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 3px;
      }
      .order-details {
        background-color: #f5f5f5;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 3px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .detail-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 8px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      }
      .detail-row:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
      }
      .label {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #666;
      }
      .value {
        color: #333;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
        color: white;
        padding: 12px 30px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #999;
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      }
      .status-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #10b981;
        color: white;
        padding: 5px 15px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 10px 0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h1>✅ Package Received by Driver</h1>
        <p>Your package is now with our delivery driver!</p>
      </div>

      <div class='content'>
        <p>Hello
          {{#if buyerName}}{{buyerName}}{{else if sellerName}}{{sellerName}}{{else}}Valued Customer{{/if}},</p>

        <div class='info-box'>
          <p><strong>Good news!</strong>
            Your package has been received by the delivery driver
            <strong>{{driverName}}</strong>
            and is now being prepared for delivery.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='order-details'>
          <div class='detail-row'>
            <span class='label'>Order Number:</span>
            <span class='value'>{{orderNumber}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class='detail-row'>
            <span class='label'>Driver:</span>
            <span class='value'>{{driverName}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class='detail-row'>
            <span class='label'>Delivery Company:</span>
            <span class='value'>{{companyName}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class='detail-row'>
            <span class='label'>Delivery Address:</span>
            <span class='value'>{{deliveryAddress}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class='detail-row'>
            <span class='label'>Status:</span>
            <span class='value'><span class='status-badge'>PACKAGE RECEIVED</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>Your package has been successfully received and verified by our delivery driver. The
          driver will now proceed to pick up the package and deliver it to your address.</p>

        <p style='text-align: center;'>
          <a href='{{trackingLink}}' class='cta-button'>Track Your Delivery</a>
        </p>

        <p><strong>What's Next?</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>The driver will pick up your package shortly</li>
          <li>You'll receive a notification when the package is out for delivery</li>
          <li>The driver will contact you before arrival</li>
          <li>You'll need to provide a confirmation code for secure delivery</li>
        </ul>

        <p>You can track your delivery in real-time using the link above. If you have any questions,
          please contact us at
          <strong>support@alabamarketplace.com</strong>.</p>

        <div style='margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;'>
          <p style='font-style: italic; color: #666;'>Thank you for choosing Alaba Marketplace!</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>&copy; 2024 Alaba Marketplace. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>